sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Trigger as Internal operator command
    participant Sync as Catalogue synchronization use case
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Adapter as IGDB adapter / ACL
    participant IGDB as IGDB API
    participant Staging as Provider-adapter staging
    participant Domain as Catalogue domain validation
    participant Telemetry

    Trigger->>Sync: Start bounded synchronization
    Note over Trigger,Sync: Scheduling remains deferred until the manual command and recovery are proven
    Sync->>DB: Load curated GameIds, typed provider references and watermark
    DB-->>Sync: Current bounded catalogue scope
    Sync->>Adapter: Synchronize only the curated scope
    Adapter->>IGDB: Authenticate and fetch bounded data with rate and retry limits

    alt Authentication, rate limit, availability or response failure
        IGDB-->>Adapter: Provider failure
        Adapter-->>Sync: Stable dependency failure
        Sync->>Telemetry: Record failed run and diagnostics
        Note over Sync,DB: Continue serving the previous valid local catalogue
    else Provider response received
        IGDB-->>Adapter: Raw transport payload
        Adapter->>Adapter: Defensively map to provider-independent candidates
        Adapter->>Staging: Store mapped candidates and outcomes

        loop Each mapped candidate
            Staging->>Domain: Validate identity, provenance and coherent release tuple
            Domain->>Domain: Reject silent merges and reference conflicts
            Domain->>Domain: Validate date value + precision
            Domain->>Domain: Reject availability-as-release mapping
            Domain->>Domain: Preserve product-owned Spanish aliases
            Domain->>Domain: Evaluate cover-reference approval state

            alt New provider result outside curated catalogue
                Domain-->>Staging: Import candidate requiring explicit curation
                Note over Staging,DB: Do not create a domain Game
            else Ambiguous, conflicting or invalid evidence
                Domain-->>Staging: Review-required or rejected candidate
                Note over Staging,DB: Preserve the previous valid normalized record
            else Existing curated game with valid update
                alt Cover is new or materially changed
                    Domain-->>Staging: Valid update with cover pending_review
                    Note over Staging,DB: Keep game visible with product-owned fallback
                else Existing approved cover remains unchanged
                    Domain-->>Staging: Valid publishable update
                end
            end
        end

        Staging-->>Sync: Validated updates, staged candidates and review outcomes
        Sync->>DB: Publish only validated updates for curated catalogue members

        alt Publication succeeds
            DB-->>Sync: New valid local state and freshness watermark
            Sync->>Telemetry: Record counts, latency, retries, freshness and success
        else Publication fails
            DB-->>Sync: Roll back or reject replacement
            Sync->>Telemetry: Record SYNCHRONIZATION_WRITE_FAILED
            Note over Sync,DB: Previous valid snapshot remains available
        end
    end

    Note over Trigger,Telemetry: Synchronization never approves covers or silently expands the bounded catalogue
